{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"dfdee7d89c78fd87","name":"card_event_bolster_the_ranks","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/USA/Breakthrough/events/card_event_bolster_the_ranks","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"BOLSTER THE RANKS","text":"Give target unit plus attack and defense equal to its operation cost, then set it to 0.","flavorText":"Perhaps one of the most timely American military reinforcement occurred during the Battle of the Bulge, which according to Winston Churchill “undoubtedly the greatest American battle of the war”. The Germans had pushed through the middle of the American line, which held, but created the “bulge” that gave the battle its name. In the Belgian town of Bastogne a combined force of the 101st Airborne and elements of the 10th Armored Division held on stubbornly for 5 days in spite of being outnumbered and desperately low on supplies while waiting to be relieved. Patton’s 3rd Army was more than 100 miles, but displayed one of his greatest military feats by racing his men in record time to Bastogne to fend off the German attack and break the siege.","faction":"USA","type":"order","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":4,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_bolster_the_ranks","title":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_event_bolster_the_ranks_title","SourceString":"BOLSTER THE RANKS","LocalizedString":"BOLSTER THE RANKS"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::USA","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_event_bolster_the_ranks_text","SourceString":"Give target unit plus attack and defense equal to its operation cost, then set it to 0.","LocalizedString":"Give target unit plus attack and defense equal to its operation cost, then set it to 0."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_event_bolster_the_ranks_history","SourceString":"Perhaps one of the most timely American military reinforcement occurred during the Battle of the Bulge, which according to Winston Churchill “undoubtedly the greatest American battle of the war”. The Germans had pushed through the middle of the American line, which held, but created the “bulge” that gave the battle its name. In the Belgian town of Bastogne a combined force of the 101st Airborne and elements of the 10th Armored Division held on stubbornly for 5 days in spite of being outnumbered and desperately low on supplies while waiting to be relieved. Patton’s 3rd Army was more than 100 miles, but displayed one of his greatest military feats by racing his men in record time to Bastogne to fend off the German attack and break the siege.","LocalizedString":"Perhaps one of the most timely American military reinforcement occurred during the Battle of the Bulge, which according to Winston Churchill “undoubtedly the greatest American battle of the war”. The Germans had pushed through the middle of the American line, which held, but created the “bulge” that gave the battle its name. In the Belgian town of Bastogne a combined force of the 101st Airborne and elements of the 10th Armored Division held on stubbornly for 5 days in spite of being outnumbered and desperately low on supplies while waiting to be relieved. Patton’s 3rd Army was more than 100 miles, but displayed one of his greatest military feats by racing his men in record time to Bastogne to fend off the German attack and break the siege."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Breakthrough","isInPermanentPool":true,"draftBaseWeight":0.8,"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/USA/CandidateArtwork/WE_Candidates/t_bolster.t_bolster","SubPathString":""},"artist":"US WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/BOLSTER_THE_RANKS.BO